## 3. Master script recreated: hvac_master_2026.py
Rebuilt the docx master so it actually runs on this Pi. Fixes vs. the docx version:
- The BACnet bind call in the docx used a placeholder address and the wrong parameter name for the installed BAC0 version; corrected to bind the Pi's real LAN address (kept private here, supplied at runtime).
- Imports pinned to what works in the Pi's virtual environment, with the GPIO pin factory set explicitly — the environment's default GPIO library is older than the GPIO toolkit expects, which caused a silent-fallback warning; the pinned factory is the one the Oct-12 scripts used.
- Verified on the Pi with its own interpreter: compiles and imports cleanly.

